# Terraform state contains the root_password in plaintext — never commit.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Un-ignore the provider lock file. The PARENT ../.gitignore ignores
# `.terraform.lock.hcl` for the DigitalOcean config, and that rule is inherited
# here, so a negation is required to override it.
#
# We want this file committed: it pins the provider's exact version and package
# hashes, which matters more than usual for this one — it is unmaintained, and it
# resolves from HashiCorp's registry rather than OpenTofu's. Committing the lock
# means every machine and CI run installs the same signature-verified v0.6.4
# build. Run `tofu providers lock -platform=linux_amd64` to add other platforms
# if you also init from Linux.
!.terraform.lock.hcl
